---
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, LINK_CLASSNAME } from "~/lib/constants";
---

<section
  aria-label="About"
  class="grid gap-4 text-[var(--app-fg)] leading-snug text-pretty text-justify hyphens-auto [hyphenate-limit-chars:7_4_4]"
>
  <p>
    Work In Progress is a design and engineering studio run by <a
      href="https://bridger.to"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class={LINK_CLASSNAME}>Bridger Tower</a
    >. The studio’s work spans brand, product, websites, and web, Mac, and iOS apps for a small number of clients and
    projects at a time.
  </p>
  <p>
    Recent work includes product and web for Vercel, Laravel, Browserbase, and
    Supermetal, alongside ongoing work with early-stage teams.
  </p>
  <p>
    In addition to client work, WIP builds and ships its own products and open
    source, and publishes about the process on YouTube and X.
  </p>
  <p>
    <span class="block text-[var(--app-fg-muted)]">Commissions —</span>
    <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`} class={LINK_CLASSNAME}
      >{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a
    >
  </p>
</section>
